      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Orchestrator\nOnly plumbing lives here: trigger → intake → dedupe → hand each article to sub-workflows. Every sub-workflow has one job and a small input/output contract, so each can be tested alone with pinned data.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0b2d8855-31dc-4e9c-87d8-fb324760f289",
      "name": "Note · Sub-workflows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1540,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sub-workflows\n10 Qualify company → returns {ok, companyPageId, score, status, flags}.\n20 Find people → only for Qualified; creates linked Contacts.\n30 Enrich contacts → runs once at the end (after the run log), works through every contact with Status 'Needs email', incl. leftovers from earlier runs.\nNext: 40 Draft + judge, 50 Telegram approval.",
        "height": 190,
